  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Client",
      "items": [
        "The frontend is a plain static host on :3000; the backend serves no assets (frontend/package.json, backend/server/server.js)",
        "Game traffic uses ws://<host>:8080, overridable with ?ws= in the page URL (frontend/src/network/WebSocketClient.js:7-13)",
        "Client-side checks are UX only; the server re-checks every frame"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Server-authoritative play",
      "items": [
        "The server generates the 15x13 map, sends it in the start message, and validates moves against it (backend/server/game/map.js, backend/server/sockets/rooms.js:71-90)",
        "Bomb timers, flame range, damage and power-up drops run in the room's own 60 Hz tick (backend/server/game/gameLoop.js, backend/server/game/config.js)",
        "powerup_collect and game_over are no longer accepted from clients (backend/server/sockets/handlers.js:85-87)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust boundary",
      "items": [
        "One socket becomes one player object stored on the socket (backend/server/sockets/state.js:11-27)",
        "Moves are rejected on teleport (25px cap), wall or block collision, and a 100 px/s token-bucket travel budget (backend/server/sockets/movement.js:6-11, 68-88)",
        "Bombs use the server's own capacity and flame range, never client values (backend/server/sockets/bombs.js:60-79)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Liveness",
      "items": [
        "Ping/pong every 9s; an unanswered ping terminates the socket (backend/server/sockets/heartbeat.js:4-20)",
        "Frames are capped at 8 KB (backend/server/server.js:18)",
        "The server keeps no durable store: players, rooms and bombs live only in memory"
      ]
    }
  ]
